# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene player-fall: fall damage (HLSDK player.cpp PreThink / PostThink,
# CHalfLifeRules::FlPlayerFallDamage) on GoldSrc PM-fall's hldemo3 floor
# spot (-159 -1106 -512, level world floor; the oracle's drops there:
# test/m3/items.py fall). With the suit the HUD shows the health: 100,
# then 47 after a 444 u drop (818.4 u/s: int((818.4 - 580) * 100 / 444) =
# 53), then 35 after a 256 u drop (633.6 u/s: 12). Log: `player: fall`
# lines with the speed, damage and health. No route window (off-route).
startmap hldemo3
waitmap hldemo3 60
god 0
drop item_suit -159 -1106 -500
setpos -159 -1106 -476 10 90
wait 1
stats begin
shot standing-100
setpos -159 -1106 -32 10 90
wait 1.5
shot landed-444
setpos -159 -1106 -220 10 90
wait 1.2
shot landed-256
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
